{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:55e6f9a6f7170f88","name":"Force Adept (CL 8)","source":{"id":"source:reference-55e6f9a6f7170f88","title":"Force Adept (CL 8)","revision":25677,"timestamp":"2024-12-05T16:54:31Z","sha256":"2684723282d5e7478c8ba392d36066a7bf7dfec738ec789cfe11a3743daba220","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25677","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Adept%20%28CL%208%29&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-55e6f9a6f7170f88","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The galaxy is a vast place, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," are not the only keepers of knowledge of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Many planets boast their own population of talented individuals who are in tune with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", although the methods they employ to harness its power can vary widely. Depending on the world, a Force Adept might be seen as a valuable and revered member of society or vilified as a suspicious, even evil practitioner of mysterious power. Regardless, Force Adepts are respected by all for their ability to call upon the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to perform amazing deeds.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Force Adept provided here represents a more violent individual in tune with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},". By tapping into their inner rage, the Force Adept turns their weapon into an extension of their body, using their might and personal charisma to get what they want. Although this Force Adept lacks a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", they're still a dangerous individual in melee combat, calling upon ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," to to bolster their natural abilities and become a whirling dealer of death.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Adept Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Some Force Adepts band together, forming cabals that instruct new recruits in the way of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," (although they might call it something else)- each group has its own flavor and techniques, some of which can be baffling for more \"traditional\" Force-users, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". Force Adepts also have a close connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mystics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mystics"},", although Force Adepts are much more proactive than their contemplative counterparts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The martial-oriented Force Adept described below could be found alone or leading a group of warriors, who both respect and fear the Force Adept's combat prowess. Force Adepts found on more primitive worlds might ride steeds, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Varactyls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Varactyls"},", instead of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},". Because of their connection with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", this Force Adept could also accompany ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Adepts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Adepts"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Apprentices"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Apprentices"},", who see the value in utilizing Force Adepts' skills and the potential of converting them wholly to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Force Adept Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Adept"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Adept","referenceId":"reference:951932a80cdb57b1"}," 1*\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":["*The Force Adept only has two out of the three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talents"}," needed to qualify for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Adept"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Adept",